WEBVTT

NOTE Timings follow the eight 10-second scenes of the assembled episode and are
NOTE approximate to the spoken line, not frame-accurate.

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Hello, friends! Today we are learning how to stay clean and healthy!

2
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Hygiene means keeping our bodies and surroundings clean!

3
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.500
We should wash our hands with soap and clean water!

4
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.500
Clean hands help keep harmful germs away!

5
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:48.500
We should brush our teeth every day to keep them clean and strong!

6
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:58.500
We also keep our bodies clean by bathing regularly!

7
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:08.500
Good hygiene also means keeping our surroundings clean!

8
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.500
Wash your hands, brush your teeth, keep your body clean!

9
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.500
Clean around you, every day, stay healthy and happy!
